{
  "id": "2dBmc2mr6UvoqFdM",
  "name": "Content Repurposing Engine — one article, every channel",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Content Repurposing Engine\n`POST { url | text, tone?, audience?, brand? }`\n\n1. If a URL is given, fetch the page and strip navigation, scripts and footers\n2. **Gemini 3.6 Flash** rewrites it for LinkedIn, X, email and Instagram\n3. The webhook returns all formats as JSON\n4. Live runs are appended to a **content calendar** sheet for review",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "7f22aa97-ba22-599a-a0fa-bce73aae7b91",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "content-repurposer",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      },
